**Errors in browser console (if relevant):**

Not a console error, but the `field_preview` backend call yields:

```
{
    "values": [],
    "error": {
        "root_cause": [
            {
                "type": "document_parsing_exception",
                "reason": "[1:222] failed to parse: _id must be unset or set to [GvMPW29fWPE5Sr2ZAAABivq9G6A] but was [_id] because [.ds-metrics-logstash.monitoring-default-2023.10.04-000001] is in time_series mode"
            }
        ],
        "type": "document_parsing_exception",
        "reason": "[1:222] failed to parse: _id must be unset or set to [GvMPW29fWPE5Sr2ZAAABivq9G6A] but was [_id] because [.ds-metrics-logstash.monitoring-default-2023.10.04-000001] is in time_series mode",
        "caused_by": {
            "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
            "reason": "_id must be unset or set to [GvMPW29fWPE5Sr2ZAAABivq9G6A] but was [_id] because [.ds-metrics-logstash.monitoring-default-2023.10.04-000001] is in time_series mode"
        }
    },
    "status": 400
}
```

For payload;

```
{"index":".ds-metrics-logstash.monitoring-default-2023.10.04-000001","context":"keyword_field","script":{"source":"emit('foobar');"},"document":{[DOC_CONTENT]}}
```

**Provide logs and/or server output (if relevant):**

No seemingly relevant log in the elasticsearch.log

